  "title": "Jamaican Beef Patties",
  "description": "These Jamaican beef patties are made with curry-flavored beef stuffed in a buttery, flaky pastry dough, baked until golden brown and delicious.",
  "authors": [
    "JEFFOLEE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:30:43-04:00",
